{"parse": {"title": "Unsired", "pageid": 65210, "revid": 15344447, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Item\n|name = Unsired\n|image = [[File:Unsired.png]]\n|release = [[1 October]] [[2015]]\n|update = The Abyssal Sire\n|members = Yes\n|quest = No\n|tradeable = No\n|bankable = Yes\n|equipable = No\n|stackable = Yes\n|noteable = No\n|options = Drop\n|examine = Doesn't seem to have survived the death of its Sire.\n|value = 140000\n|alchable = No\n|weight = 0.000\n|id = 13273\n|leagueRegion = General\n}}\n[[File:Unsired detail.png|left|150px]]\nAn '''unsired''' is an untradeable item dropped by the [[Abyssal Sire]]. They are to be placed at the [[The Font of Consumption|Font of Consumption]], which consumes the unsired, but gives the player a reward in the process.\n\n==Rewards==\nWhen an unsired is offered to the Font of Consumption, a roll is performed to determine what will be received.\n* If the player has not obtained the [[abyssal orphan]], a roll out of 128 is performed, with 5 values rewarding the pet.\n* If the player has obtained the abyssal orphan, a roll out of 123 is performed, with 0 values rewarding the pet.\n\n===Bludgeon pieces===\n''The drop rate of any bludgeon piece is 62/128. The player may not obtain any duplicate pieces until all three pieces have been obtained per bludgeon.''\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=General}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Bludgeon claw|quantity=1|rarity=62/128|altrarity=62/123|raritynotes={{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Kieren|url=https://twitter.com/JagexKieren/status/665177260698288128|date=13 November 2015|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/104972|archivedate=25 May 2020|quote=Here are the Abyssal Sire drop rates in case you didn't catch them on @JagexRonan's stream. 62/128 is any piece :) [https://pbs.twimg.com/media/CTsvMW6XIAIlDbd.png]|name=sire}}{{CiteDiscord|author=Mod Ash|url=https://discord.com/channels/324132423636090880/431834766325841920/1386618558557192252|date=23 June 2025|quote=If you DO have the pet already, it rolls out of 123, with none of those values giving the pet.|image=Sire droprate.png|ctximage=Sire_droprate_context.png|ctxquote=If you already have the Abyssal Sire pet, in what way does this affect the droprate of unsireds and/or the chances of the items you can get from an unsired?|name=hasPet|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/27962712#chat-messages-431834766325841920-1386618558557192252|archivedate=2026-03-07}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Bludgeon spine|quantity=1|rarity=62/128|altrarity=62/123|raritynotes={{NamedRef|sire}}{{NamedRef|hasPet}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Bludgeon axon|quantity=1|rarity=62/128|altrarity=62/123|raritynotes={{NamedRef|sire}}{{NamedRef|hasPet}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Weapons===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=General}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Abyssal dagger|quantity=1|rarity=26/128|altrarity=26/123|raritynotes={{NamedRef|sire}}{{NamedRef|hasPet}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Abyssal whip|quantity=1|rarity=12/128|altrarity=12/123|raritynotes={{NamedRef|sire}}{{NamedRef|hasPet}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=General}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Jar of Miasma|quantity=1|rarity=13/128|altrarity=13/123|raritynotes={{NamedRef|sire}}{{NamedRef|hasPet}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Abyssal head|quantity=1|rarity=10/128|altrarity=10/123|raritynotes={{NamedRef|sire}}{{NamedRef|hasPet}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Abyssal orphan|quantity=1|rarity=5/128|altrarity=Never|raritynotes={{refn|group=d|The pet is removed as a potential drop if one is already owned, unless it is currently reclaimable from [[Probita]].{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://x.com/JagexAsh/status/1258351161561821189|date=7 May 2020|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/27963029|archivedate=11 May 2020|quote=It re-rolls the unsired's contents, omitting the pet from the table.}}}}{{NamedRef|sire}}\n}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\nWhen combined with the drop rate of the unsired, the effective chances of each item are:\n{| class=\"wikitable align-center-1\"\n!\n!Item\n!Chance per<br/>Abyssal Sire kill\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Bludgeon claw}}\n| rowspan=\"3\" | 1/206; 1/198\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Bludgeon spine}}\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Bludgeon axon}}\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Abyssal dagger}}\n|1/492; 1/473\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Jar of Miasma}}\n|1/984; 1/946\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Abyssal whip}}\n|1/1,066; 1/1025\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Abyssal head}}\n|1/1,280; 1/1230\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Abyssal orphan}}\n|1/2,560; N/A\n|}\n\nNote that if a player has a given bludgeon piece, duplicate pieces will not be obtained. For example, if the player obtains a [[bludgeon axon]] and the next unsired rolls into the bludgeon table, only a [[bludgeon spine]] or [[bludgeon claw|claw]] can be rolled.\n\nWhen the rarities and prices of each possible tradeable reward is taken into account, the expected value of an unsired is {{Coins|floor((26/128)*{{GEP|Abyssal dagger}}+(12/128)*{{GEP|Abyssal whip}}+(13/128)*{{GEP|Jar of Miasma}}+(62/128/3)*{{GEP|Abyssal bludgeon}})}}, or {{Coins|floor((26/123)*{{GEP|Abyssal dagger}}+(12/123)*{{GEP|Abyssal whip}}+(13/123)*{{GEP|Jar of Miasma}}+(62/123/3)*{{GEP|Abyssal bludgeon}})}} if the player already owns the [[abyssal orphan]].\n[[File:Unsired.gif|frame|A player places the unsired at the Font of Consumption, found behind The Overseer.]]\n\n==Item sources==\n{{Drop sources|Unsired}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 2 September 2026\n|update = Summer Sweep Up Miscellaneous\n|change = Unsireds are now stackable, and their loot is rolled when used on the Font of Consumption, rather than being decided when it drops.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==Trivia==\n*While untradeable and having a [[high alchemy]] value of 84,000 coins (in spite of its standard value of 144,000 coins), when obtained, the clan broadcast gives it a value of 200,000 coins.\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Abyssal Sire}}\n\n[[Category:Collection log items]]"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:41.774064+00:00", "dropHtml":